1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,718
Each pyruvate loses one carbon as carbon dioxide and gives up hydrogen to make NADH.

2
00:00:06,718 --> 00:00:12,356
The two-carbon remainder is attached to coenzyme A, as acetyl coenzyme A.

3
00:00:12,356 --> 00:00:16,966
For one glucose that is two carbon dioxide and two more NADH.

